---
// D/R mark from `docs/DESIGN_NOTES.md`'s Brand direction — a TV silhouette
// (the "Better Than TV" motif) with the D/R initials filled from the same
// five section colors used elsewhere in the nav. The D and R are baked as
// static vector paths (extracted from the site's own self-hosted Fraunces
// font, not live text) so the mark never depends on a webfont being loaded -
// this matters most for the favicon, which shares this exact path data
// (see public/favicon.svg) and can't rely on page fonts being available.
---

